        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You or an ally within 30 feet is reduced to 0 Hit Points.</p><p><strong>Effect</strong> It was not going to happen today. The target is reduced to <strong>1 Hit Point</strong> instead, gains <strong>temporary Hit Points equal to your level</strong>, and does not gain the wounded condition from this instance. A creature cannot benefit from this Augury again for 10 minutes.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The target also regains <strong>2d8</strong> Hit Points. <strong>(+2)</strong> +2d8.</p><hr /><p><em>When it triggers, a button appears in your whispers; it spends the Focus Point and the reaction.</em></p>"
